{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16147","headline":"田侍中宴席 · 王建","name":"田侍中宴席","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香熏罗幕暖成烟，火照中庭烛满筵。\n整顿舞衣呈玉腕，动摇歌扇露金钿。\n青蛾侧座调双管，彩凤斜飞入五弦。\n虽是沂公门下客，争将肉眼看云天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}